# What is NOT sent to the Docker daemon as build context. It keeps secrets out of every image layer
# and stops the project's local caches (kept inside the project on purpose) and the developer's
# node_modules and previous build output from being uploaded on every build.
#
# tests/ is deliberately NOT ignored: `next build` type-checks it (see tsconfig.json).

# Secrets and local configuration: never in a build context.
.env
.env.*

# Dependencies and build output: the image installs and builds its own.
node_modules
.next
out
.npm-cache

# Tooling output
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo
